	)
	(text "Inter-digit rules (all on rails; masters are stable during CK so no ripple races):\n  pL: AIN = CK, ZIN = NCK (advances every clock).  LC / ZL = pL carry rail pair (CK and l = 25 / its complement).\n  pM: AIN = LC (advances when l wraps).  A1B / Z1B = pM carry rails = m wraps -> a1 advance / hold.\n  pM NOUT = A2B = CK and l wraps and m <> 25 -> a2 advance.  Z2B = ZL OR A1B = its complement -> a2 hold.\n  a3: AIN = NL = CK and l <> 25 (NOUT of pL); ZIN = Z3I = NCK OR LC.  a3/pL/pM/pR presets tie P0..P4 to 0 V = clear.\n  pR (0003 K3): AIN = A1B, ZIN = Z1B, preset 0 = bank-level r digit. POS connector J4 = l (L0-4), m (M0-4), r (R0-4).\nBus J2 (to every unit board J1): A2B Z2B A1B Z1B, L0-L4 (a4), T0-T4 (a3), LOAD, 0 V (16-18 reserved; power only at J3)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 150 130 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f7859e6b-73eb-59c6-82ff-f713f8719b85")
	)
